written source sweeps
model vsource vsource
model isource isource
subckt s (p n)
  v2 (p n) vsource dc=1
ends
v1 (a 0) vsource dc=1
i1 (a 0) isource dc=1m
x1 (b 0) s
control
  sweep vg instance="v1" parameter="dc" from=0 to=5 step=0.1
  sweep ig instance="i1" parameter="dc" values=[0, 1m]
    analysis dc1 op
  sweep vs instance="x1:v2" parameter="dc" values=[1, 2]
    analysis dc2 op
  sweep vl instance="v1" parameter="dc" values=[1, 2]
    analysis t1 tran stop=1m
endc
